  "headings": [
    "## CMP-1 \u2014 the five defects bedrock-platform reported",
    "## CMP-2 \u2014 the ranked queue",
    "## CMP-3 \u2014 what blocks bedrock-platform's next update",
    "## CMP-4 \u2014 keel enforces what it claims, and emits evidence jarvis can read",
    "## CMP-5 \u2014 the coding rules move from text an agent reads into code the gate runs",
    "## CMP-6 \u2014 a generated project is proven whole, and the two high gaps close",
    "## CMP-7 \u2014 a document answers for the features it serves",
    "## CMP-8 \u2014 a rule a tool can decide is held by a check",
    "## CMP-9 \u2014 a test shows it can fail",
    "## CMP-10 \u2014 a refused config file stops every reader, and a wrong claim in a doc is caught",
    "## CMP-11 \u2014 parallel slices stop colliding in the shared files",
    "## CMP-12 \u2014 a fence inside a list or a quote is read as a renderer reads it",
    "## CMP-13 \u2014 a test gate credits only an assertion that runs, and reads its policy through the loader",
    "## CMP-14 \u2014 a gate sees every change it claims to judge",
    "## CMP-15 \u2014 config conversion failures end in a named refusal or one finding",
    "## CMP-16 \u2014 document checks read tables through one GFM grammar",
    "## CMP-17 \u2014 an unreadable tool report fails the agent run",
    "## CMP-18 \u2014 one excluded cabinet and a reachable index for shipped documents",
    "## CMP-19 \u2014 every structure check has an id and a failing twin",
    "## CMP-20 \u2014 blank-line HTML blocks cannot manufacture fences",
    "## CMP-21 \u2014 interrupted refactors recover the whole change set",
    "## CMP-22 \u2014 writers confine mutations to their authorized tree",
    "## CMP-23 \u2014 a generated project learns what the template fixed, and its test loop is quick without standing in for the gate",
    "## CMP-24 \u2014 a shipped document that reports a change fails the prose gate"
  ],
